S5. [symbolic] Substitute u = -3 into the first original equation -> {{5(-3) = -7 - 2v => -15 = -7 - 2v}}
S6. [symbolic] Isolate the v term -> {{-15 + 7 = -2v => -8 = -2v}}
S7. [symbolic] Divide by -2 -> {{-8 = -2v => v = 4}}

