V1. Substitute u = -3 and v = 4 into the first equation and subtract the right side -> <<5*(-3)-(-7-2*4)=0>>
V2. Substitute u = -3 and v = 4 into the second equation and subtract the right side -> <<3*(-3)-(4*4-25)=0>>

[Answer]
\boxed{(-3,4)}

